  {
    "name": "book_appointment",
    "description": "Book an appointment for the identified caller. Call this ONLY after (1) the caller is identified via lookup_patient, (2) you have offered slots returned by check_availability, and (3) the caller has explicitly confirmed a specific slot you read back. This is the success action \u2014 never call it without confirmation, and never claim success unless it returns a confirmation_number. For a reschedule, book the confirmed replacement before cancelling the old appointment.",
